### Notification Service API Tests
### Direct Service: http://localhost:8086
### Via API Gateway: http://localhost:8080

### Health Check (Direct)
GET http://localhost:8086/notifications/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Health Check (Via API Gateway)
GET http://localhost:8080/notifications/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a Notification (Ticket Created) - Direct
POST http://localhost:8086/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientId": "admin-001",
  "title": "New Ticket Created",
  "message": "A new support ticket #12345 has been created by John Doe",
  "type": "TICKET_CREATED",
  "relatedEntityId": "12345",
  "relatedEntityType": "TICKET"
}

###

### Create a Notification (Via API Gateway)
POST http://localhost:8080/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientId": "admin-001",
  "title": "New Ticket Created",
  "message": "A new support ticket #12345 has been created by John Doe",
  "type": "TICKET_CREATED",
  "relatedEntityId": "12345",
  "relatedEntityType": "TICKET"
}

###

### Create Another Notification - Direct - Direct
POST http://localhost:8086ifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientId": "admin-001",
  "title": "Ticket Updated",
  "message": "Ticket #12345 has been updated with new information",
  "type": "TICKET_UPDATED",
  "relatedEntityId": "12345",
  "relatedEntityType": "TICKET"
}

###

### Create Notification for Different User
POST http://localhost:8084/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientId": "user-123",
  "title": "Ticket Assigned",
  "message": "You have been assigned to ticket #67890",
  "type": "TICKET_ASSIGNED",
  "relatedEntityId": "67890",
  "relatedEntityType": "TICKET"
}

###

### Get All Notifications - Direct
GET http://localhost:8086/notifications
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Notifications (Via API Gateway)
GET http://localhost:8080/notifications
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Notifications by Recipient (admin-001) - Direct
GET http://localhost:8086/notifications/recipient/admin-001
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Notifications by Recipient (Via API Gateway)
GET http://localhost:8080/notifications/recipient/admin-001
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Unread Notifications by Recipient
GET http://localhost:8086/notifications/recipient/admin-001/unread
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Unread Count for Recipient
GET http://localhost:8086/notifications/recipient/admin-001/unread/count
Accept: application/json

###

### Mark Notification as Read (replace {id} with actual ID from previous responses)
PUT http://localhost:8086/notifications/1/read
Accept: application/json

###

### Mark All Notifications as Read for Recipient
PUT http://localhost:8086/notifications/recipient/admin-001/read-all
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete a Notification (replace {id} with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8086/notifications/1

###
